   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": "-654925",
   "questID": 96652,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<The journal appears to be quite plain, detailing the life and adventures of someone you've never heard of.\r\n\r\nThere are multiple entries mentioning camping. It seems to be quite... fun.>",
   "time": 1791731710,
   "title": "The Adventurer",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "96873-accept": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Pa'zula",
   "npc": "266881",
   "questID": 96873,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The trolls east of here have lost their will to the witchdoctor, Zalazane. He uses many cruel magics to keep hold of his prisoners' minds, but one of his favorite tricks is to make them wear pendants wrapped in evil binding spells.\r\n\r\nPractice your enchanting skills by stripping the magic from these pendants, and bring me the results. And don't accidentally put one around your neck, if you value your freedom!",
   "time": 1791740187,
   "title": "A Pain in the Neck",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "96873-complete": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Pa'zula",
   "npc": "266881",
   "questID": 96873,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Fine work. A shame about the slain trolls, but with the binding spells removed, their spirits can rest.",
   "time": 1791751798,
   "title": "A Pain in the Neck",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "96873-progress": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Pa'zula",
   "npc": "266881",
   "questID": 96873,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "What do you have for me, $N?",
   "time": 1791751797,
   "title": "A Pain in the Neck",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "97281-accept": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": null,
   "questID": 97281,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<Before you is a strange orb with a dull surface. When picked up a small electrical current seems to vibrate from within. Upon closer inspection, it looks as if a dark mist swirls within and every so often a small electrical spark can be seen.\r\n\r\nIt is clear the harpy was using it for some purpose. Perhaps Rezlak would be interested in this object?>",
   "time": 1791971446,
   "title": "A Simmering Storm",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "97904-accept": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Brakk",
   "npc": "265809",
   "questID": 97904,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You might not think so, but your skill as a fisherman can actually come in handy at camp.\r\n\r\nI reckon I know someone that can teach you how to craft a Fish Bowl for your camp. You can use this fixture to help provide a bit of joy to yourself and your fellow adventurers. A happy adventurer is a strong adventurer and I'm sure your combat capabilities will reflect that.",
   "time": 1791741689,
   "title": "Camping 101: Fishing",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  },
  "97904-complete": {
   "build": "70374",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Lau'Tiki",
   "npc": "5941",
   "questID": 97904,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Dere ya have it, ya be craftin' your very own Fish Bowl. Most folk don't be carin' much for camps being set up in da center of town, so ya be needin' ta head into da wilderness if ya be wantin' to try it out.\r\n\r\nNo camp is complete without a campfire, mon. Ya be needin' one of dose before ya be startin' up your camp. Most cooks be teachin' ya ta make a fire. Check in with someone who can train ya in da culinary arts if ya haven't already learned da basics.",
   "time": 1791969554,
   "title": "Camping 101: Fishing",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  }
 },
